This package extends @deepseek-ai/dsh-compaction-basic
(https://www.npmjs.com/package/@deepseek-ai/dsh-compaction-basic), which is
distributed under the MIT License and provides the compaction transaction used
here: the bracket lock (compaction/start … compaction/end), shrink validation,
and the surface replacement. This package replaces that backend's trigger policy
and its summarize() hook, and does not redistribute upstream source.

